  "sources": [
    "amd-knobs.md: every AMD env var and flag with a concrete name in the tables of §1-§9; NUM -> numerics, OP (and §0 rule 7's policies) -> op_dependent. Left out: §10 (load time and plumbing), names written with wildcards or braces, and the rows that say they are not server variables (MM3_HIGH_CONC_FASTPATH, VLLM_BLOCK_SIZE, AITER_MXFP4_*).",
    "numerics-knobs.md: every env var and flag it names, numerics true (§9's settings are its own 'not numerics'). Config-file keys (TRT-LLM yaml, keys inside --speculative-config) are not env vars or flags and are left out.",
    "bundles: amd-knobs.md §0 rule 6's table, members as named in §1-§8; big-directions.md D3/D4/D5/D8 cited where they spell the same set. A member the table marks optional is in `when`, not in `members`."
  ],
